{"id":"af98bb2babeee14b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-numeralwise-express.md","title":"Numeralwise Express","display":"df-numeralwise-express — Numeralwise Express","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-numeralwise-express","aliases":["90-df-numeralwise-express"],"display":"df-numeralwise-express — Numeralwise Express","depends_on":["[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-numeralwise-express"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-numeralwise-express</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeralwise-express — Numeralwise Express"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v\">\\(\\vec v\\)</span> 为按顺序指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个互异变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v]\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v]\\)</span>，即所有自由变量均在该列内；数码及代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的固定有限推导。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumExpress}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumExpress}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T(R,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v]\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\Bigl[\n(\\vec n\\in R\\to T\\vdash\\varphi[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v])\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin R\\to T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v])\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NumExpress}_T(R,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v]\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\Bigl[\n(\\vec n\\in R\\to T\\vdash\\varphi[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v])\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin R\\to T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v])\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留正反两向的逐数表示含义，不改成只证明真例的弱表示。变量列的顺序随公式接口固定；允许某个参数未实际出现，不允许未列出的自由参数。需要恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个自由变量的公式时，可加入对应自反等式而不改变表示性。元数和理论无歧义时省略它们的类型注记。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmeti